    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      464.58,
      295.24,
      528.54
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land called \u201cPallemaluwa\u201d in extent of about1.064 Hectare, shown in the Advance Tracing No. NU/UDH/97/163and dated 26.12.1997, prepared by the Surveyor-General situated inthe Village of Hanguranketha in Diyathilaka Korale Minor Divisonin the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Udahewahete in NuwaraEliya District, Central Province and bounded as follows:",
